bool iTtLines = input.bool(true, "Show the HTF candle open", group = G_C, tooltip = "the open of the current HTF candle (short line), and the T-Spot: after a bullish (bearish) C2 / C3 closure, the upper (lower) half of that candle, from its high (low) to its 50%. TTrades: during an expansion the next HTF candle's wick should form there; look for a PD array inside it. if there is no closure, the 50% line is shown instead")
